This distribution contains an evaluation wrapper for OpenMLS, Copyright OpenMLS
Authors, used under the MIT License. The wrapper pins OpenMLS 0.8.1 for evaluation;
it is not a claim that the VOLNA integration has completed an independent audit.

The JavaScript runtime uses ts-mls 1.6.2, hpke-js packages 1.7.x-1.9.x, and Noble
Cryptography packages 2.x under their MIT licenses. Exact versions and upstream
locations are recorded in DEPENDENCIES.md and the package lockfile.

The public React Native/Web security and message surfaces use Expo Camera,
Clipboard, Audio, Image, and Location, Socket.IO Client, Lucide,
react-native-qrcode-svg, and react-native-svg under their respective licenses.
Exact integration versions are recorded in DEPENDENCIES.md and the package lockfile.
